### REST API - Create Order
POST http://localhost:8080/order
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 100.50,
  "tax": 10.05
}

### REST API - List Orders
GET http://localhost:8080/order

### REST API - Get Order By ID
GET http://localhost:8080/order/your-order-id-here

### REST API - Update Order
PUT http://localhost:8080/order/your-order-id-here
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 200.00,
  "tax": 20.00
}

### REST API - Delete Order
DELETE http://localhost:8080/order/your-order-id-here

### GraphQL - Create Order (Mutation)
POST http://localhost:8081/graphql
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "mutation { createOrder(price: 150.75, tax: 15.08) { id price tax final_price } }"
}

### GraphQL - List Orders (Query)
POST http://localhost:8081/graphql
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "{ listOrders { id price tax final_price } }"
}

### GraphQL - Get Order By ID (Query)
POST http://localhost:8081/graphql
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "{ getOrder(id: \"your-order-id-here\") { id price tax final_price } }"
}

### GraphQL - Update Order (Mutation)
POST http://localhost:8081/graphql
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "mutation { updateOrder(id: \"your-order-id-here\", price: 250.00, tax: 25.00) { id price tax final_price } }"
}

### GraphQL - Delete Order (Mutation)
POST http://localhost:8081/graphql
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "mutation { deleteOrder(id: \"your-order-id-here\") }"
}
